    "learningOutcome": "Students interpret similarity through scale factor.",
    "type": "Knowledge",
    "text": "The scale factor that relates the areas of two similar objects is the square of the scale factor that relates the side lengths.",
    "sourcePage": 8,
    "source": "Alberta Draft Mathematics (7–9) Curriculum, June 2026, ©2026 Government of Alberta | Education and Childcare; Draft Curriculum: Optional Classroom Piloting in 2026–27"
