    "type": "Knowledge",
    "text": "Rate of change describes the change in one variable with respect to another variable in a situation modelled by a function, such as\n• constant speed\n• hourly wages\n• filling a container at a constant rate",
    "sourcePage": 11,
    "source": "Alberta Draft Mathematics (7–9) Curriculum, June 2026, ©2026 Government of Alberta | Education and Childcare; Draft Curriculum: Optional Classroom Piloting in 2026–27"
