    "organizingIdeaDescription": "Understandings of the physical world are deepened by investigating matter and energy.",
    "guidingQuestion": "How can states of matter and other physical properties be explained by using the particle model of matter?",
    "learningOutcome": "Students investigate the particle model of matter in relation to the physical properties of solids, liquids, and gases.",
